{"id":996,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>六月芳华逐梦远航，青春扬楫奔赴新程。6月14日上午，我院2026届毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式于科艺苑隆重举办。本次仪式由学院党委副书记郭元君主持，学院党委书记常旭青、院长秦品乐、科研副院长况立群、物联网工程系主任王丽芳、计算机科学与技术系副主任张凯涵、数据科学与大数据技术系副主任闫俊义出席现场，全体毕业班班主任、辅导员与毕业生家长齐聚一堂，共同见证全体学子圆满完成求学之路，奔赴人生崭新征程。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nR-FsUNrVn7Uio9R7YMmrRollDM4vAbMz9iLRWRLl7ZM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyDMSy4oSyaUNrfLRV7MNUbLz6fLNrRL8MknRC8LzL8M4rFL8WRoRvYLzQFMlnRnmlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E65390BEA01D6D917A2EC3CBD6413475/3BC87216/5DCF5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 525px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_M8UFDnN7sMN-ao97CYLlrfMmAkLzUADnRl8Llr7M4lsolU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiUYh2MkyZUmU4nR9io7WRUNnVoRUDMmLiLlLYM4WRnlrFUmG4nmWfUm6FLzW7LzUDgjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLRLZg47YMRl4gtA8pU1cc&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.png\"></p><p></p><p>仪式在庄严的国歌中正式开启。院长秦品乐寄语全体毕业生，肯定大家在校期间勤学笃行、科创争先的优异表现，结合行业发展与时代使命勉励学子坚守理想、脚踏实地，以所学所长担当时代责任。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_LzLFbLmv8LlWVM9R-DMz6RLRUYU8rAVnmUDUm-iLmUsU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0oShRoSyiM1yDU87bMzGaL4TkM498M49Ynm9iMzMkMlLDUzrFMNUbozUPnzAFL4v4M49Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9C9566CA950039B784782F8553B5C6A5/6D9941E8/37378\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 530px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_LRnFVnN-iLzVVn9lUaMRGDUz-Pol7AiLm-DLzUaozUbL7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8nkysMYhRM8LYnRVVMlLPnmr2Uz9PLlUsLNrfMznRUzrFnmNsUz-inzfFU8nkM7UJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.jpg\"></p><p>副院长况立群宣读校院两级优秀毕业生、院级优秀毕业生干部表彰决定并颁发证书，表彰先进、树立榜样。<br>毕业生代表韩泽斌回望校园岁月，感恩母校培育与师长教诲；在校生代表王艺博表态将以榜样为力量，接续奋进。<br>学院党委书记常旭青作总结讲话，嘱托青年学子牢记使命担当，胸怀理想、砥砺奋进，在时代浪潮中勇立潮头。</p><p><font>&nbsp;</font></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nz9FanNrRnml8n9m9DnNUZMmL4M4NAZnNCsMlnVLRVfMlU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybn1ysU1ybLN-snm7soz6VoRrVMRvPnmAfMlCPo7lZMRTFMzlDozCiM4rFL8lsnmCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F9F7B92B7F1797E85E471F8A5F18E849/55696575/3E7F6\" vheight=\" 580px\" vwidth=\" 528px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nmCFYMNl4o7rfL9NUiM8UiMmCsoRVAVoz7PnzGbnmMVoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyanShfLShVU4rRnmTknzlbLlLaLR7PU4vsnmVfLRN4MmQFLzG4LzUZL7rFL4VRLl-agjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLRLZg47YMRl4gtA8pU1cc&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.png\"></p><p></p><p>随后举行学位授予仪式，现场宣读学位授予决定。学院领导为全体毕业生拨穗正冠、颁发学位证书，师生合影留念，留存珍贵瞬间。典礼在嘹亮的校歌声中圆满结束。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nRGF4MzLbolLbU946fLzr7MlM2nlnAVLmvDoRCDMzLbUNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy4MSyZLkyanR-sU8rfo7MfUzG8ol-sU4n2MNCaMmLanm6FoRU8n7UDnzWFMR7anRNJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/735800D27CEA8CAA049B7C4F6F0630F7/844DD6E2/410D9\" vheight=\" 175px\" vwidth=\" 539px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nRGF4MzLbolLbU946fLzr7MlM2nlnAVLmvDoRCDMzLbUNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy4MSyZLkyanR-sU8rfo7MfUzG8ol-sU4n2MNCaMmLanm6FoRU8n7UDnzWFMR7anRNJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nz-FsLm-iMmC4o9z-DnmlbU4f2n7WAkLzffMm62nzlZLmN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyinShRU1yaMNLYLNL8nRGPL4NsMRL4o7n7Mll8olLaMRAFnRAfo7QkU4AFL8QRol7Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/95ECB06C22C4D013974338DD5E49C048/D8A8FBC8/3FC9A\" vheight=\" 538px\" vwidth=\" 537px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_L8rF2U4CYnlL4L97nVo7W2L4AVnlUADLR-Pnln7LmM7U4L0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyaoSyDn1yDU4U8nmTVMmA7o7W7ozLbnRMfoR6RU4NDo7nFM7-aMm9soRWFnzUPMmCJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.jpg\"></p><p>征程万里风正劲，重任千钧再出发。祝愿全体毕业生怀揣母校厚望，以青春之姿践行理想、勇担使命，在强国建设、民族复兴的征程中大展宏图，书写无愧于时代的青春答卷！</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nR-FsUNrVn7Uio9R7YMmrRollDM4vAbMz9iLRWRLl7ZM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyDMSy4oSyaUNrfLRV7MNUbLz6fLNrRL8MknRC8LzL8M4rFL8WRoRvYLzQFMlnRnmlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aL490Lz-8MzLJqd1nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1038&nid=12453&e=.png"}